    "favourites.add": {
      "comment": "Command in a tab's own menu (on a Mac in the File menu, for the tab in front): the tab becomes one of the row's Favourites, the small tiles at its beginning. A tab that is no Site is kept as one by it. Grey when the row has as many Favourites as it can.",
